+    "basic": "### Choose a topic\n- Where sales and settings live, and how Shopify sync works: [[concepts/data-and-sync]].\n- What staff roles mean and who can use or change settings: [[concepts/roles]].\n- How cents, GST and rounding are handled: [[concepts/money]].\n- Words and labels used in the POS: [[concepts/glossary]].",
+    "deep": "### Local first, then shared\nThe register keeps working data on this iPad and shares selected records with Shopify. A completed sale is saved locally before its Shopify upload finishes. Staff, some settings, catalogue and stock are shared or refreshed separately, so two screens can briefly show different update times.",
